{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_uL3AGAzXtzpM9eMMyZ1tcsvY","content":"1\t# nightly-review (snapshot of my home dir, the relevant bits)\n2\t\n3\tA launchd user agent runs `bin/nightly-review.zsh` every night at 02:30. The\n4\tscript asks a headless coding agent to review yesterday's commits in\n5\t~/projects/shop and sends me the summary (or a failure note) over Telegram\n6\tvia `bin/notify.sh`.\n7\t\n8\tLayout, relative to my home:\n9\t\n10\t- `Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist` — loaded with\n11\t  `launchctl bootstrap gui/$UID ...` on 2026-10-12\n12\t- `bin/nightly-review.zsh` — the job\n13\t- `bin/notify.sh` — Telegram notifier (works when run by hand)\n14\t- `Library/Logs/` — where the plist points stdout/stderr\n15\t- `launchctl-print.txt` — output of `launchctl print gui/501/com.vk.nightly-review`, captured 2026-10-18 09:10\n16\t\n17\tI have received nothing on Telegram since it was loaded: no summaries, no\n18\tfailure notes."}
{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_HxoU0vQGjnMjY1mvUJtnZdk4","content":"1\tgui/501/com.vk.nightly-review = {\n2\t\tactive count = 0\n3\t\tpath = /Users/vk/Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist\n4\t\ttype = LaunchAgent\n5\t\tstate = waiting\n6\t\n7\t\tprogram = /bin/zsh\n8\t\targuments = {\n9\t\t\t/bin/zsh\n10\t\t\t/Users/vk/bin/nightly-review.zsh\n11\t\t}\n12\t\n13\t\tstdout path = /Users/vk/Library/Logs/nightly-review.out\n14\t\tstderr path = /Users/vk/Library/Logs/nightly-review.err\n15\t\tdefault environment = {\n16\t\t\tPATH => /usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin\n17\t\t}\n18\t\n19\t\tenvironment = {\n20\t\t\tPATH => /opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin\n21\t\t\tXPC_SERVICE_NAME => com.vk.nightly-review\n22\t\t}\n23\t\n24\t\tdomain = gui/501 [100005]\n25\t\tminimum runtime = 10\n26\t\texit timeout = 5\n27\t\truns = 6\n28\t\tlast exit code = 1\n29\t\n30\t\tevent triggers = {\n31\t\t\tcom.vk.nightly-review.StartCalendarInterval => {\n32\t\t\t\tkeep alive = 0\n33\t\t\t\tservice = com.vk.nightly-review\n34\t\t\t\tname = com.vk.nightly-review.StartCalendarInterval\n35\t\t\t\tdescriptor = {\n36\t\t\t\t\t\"Hour\" => 2\n37\t\t\t\t\t\"Minute\" => 30\n38\t\t\t\t}\n39\t\t\t}\n40\t\t}\n41\t\n42\t\tspawn type = daemon (3)\n43\t\tproperties = {\n44\t\t\tpartial import = 0\n45\t\t\tlaunchd bundle = 0\n46\t\t\ttrusted = 0\n47\t\t\ton demand = 1\n48\t\t}\n49\t}"}
{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_0JGahCfeOcTIQLgz9mLnJDw2","content":"1\t#!/bin/zsh\n2\t# Nightly review of yesterday's commits, summary to Telegram.\n3\tset -u\n4\t\n5\tREPO=\"$HOME/projects/shop\"\n6\tOUT=\"$HOME/Library/Logs/nightly-review-$(date +%F).md\"\n7\tNOTIFY=\"$HOME/bin/notify.sh\"\n8\t\n9\tSINCE=$(date -v-1d +%F)\n10\tPROMPT=\"Review the commits in this repository since $SINCE.\n11\tFor each commit: one line on what it changes and whether anything looks risky\n12\t(migrations, auth, payments, deleted tests).\n13\tEnd with a three-line summary I can read on my phone.\n14\tDo not modify any file.\"\n15\t\n16\tcd \"$REPO\" || { \"$NOTIFY\" \"nightly review: repo missing\"; exit 1; }\n17\t\n18\tclaude -p \"$PROMPT\" --output-format text > \"$OUT\"\n19\tstatus=$?\n20\t\n21\tif [ $status -ne 0 ]; then\n22\t  \"$NOTIFY\" \"nightly review FAILED (exit $status), see $OUT\"\n23\t  exit $status\n24\tfi\n25\t\n26\t\"$NOTIFY\" \"nightly review done: $(head -c 300 \"$OUT\")\""}
{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_Vrg5xWYeS05NPBAsypErtppd","content":"1\t#!/bin/bash\n2\t# usage: notify.sh \"message\"  — sends a Telegram message to me.\n3\tset -eu\n4\t: \"${TG_BOT_TOKEN:=$(security find-generic-password -s tg-bot -w)}\"\n5\tCHAT_ID=123456789\n6\tcurl -sS -X POST \"https://api.telegram.org/bot${TG_BOT_TOKEN}/sendMessage\" \\\n7\t  -d chat_id=\"$CHAT_ID\" --data-urlencode text=\"$1\" > /dev/null"}
